<para>Reads the visit id from <computeroutput>data_j</computeroutput> using CREATE_KEY and delegates to the <ref refid="classCase" kindref="compound">Case</ref> base, which joins <computeroutput>clinics</computeroutput> with <computeroutput>clinics_visits</computeroutput> on clinic_id. <ref refid="gatekeeper_8cpp_1ae17e951f1dc80a8e4920571ebe9f3c21" kindref="member">PermissionManager</ref> runs the returned SELECT before the insert; no insert occurs here. <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
